# The hero's balance by hand against G2's dice (docs/manual-aim.md, stage 4): four tiers as G2 has them plus three strength/dexterity builds (the
# talent, the bow, its strength and dexterity, the trained animations), at a farmer 10, 20 and 30 m off, aimed
# at the body and at the head; 30 shots each, held 300-600 ms (the sway is a function of time), a seed each
# Quiet repeat after #844 still drifts >5 cm with still player on; ON/OFF remains blocked (#827, see report).
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
turn 210
wait 500
arrow feature off
give ItRw_Arrow 2000
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
still BAU_904_BAUER on
cam follow 300 80 165
cam look 150

equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
stats str 10 dex 10 bow 10 talent auto
tap bow
wait 1500
put BAU_904_BAUER 1000 0 0
wait 300
zones BAU_904_BAUER
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
seed 1
rec nov10_body novideo
volley 30 300 1 300
stop
aimat BAU_904_BAUER head
seed 2
rec nov10_head novideo
volley 30 300 1 300
stop
